{"id":"4634","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4634_main_spray_hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>喷雾是由从水体表面的风吹起的水滴集合产生，通常来自波峰，水滴可向上吹向空中。</p>\n<p>这张照片显示的是太平洋海浪波峰的风吹起的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">喷雾</span>，海浪被吹向了美国加利福尼亚州海岸。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mila Zinkova","location":"美国加利福尼亚皮拉波音特","latitude":"纬度: 37° 29' 53'' N","longitude":"经度: 122° 29' 55'' W","date":"24 January 2014 1420 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.3"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4633_main_spray-and-a-sea-spray-bow_hydrometeors-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">喷雾</span>是由从广阔水体表面的风吹起的水滴集合产生，通常来自波峰，并可向上吹向空中一小段距离。</p>\n<p>在这张照片中，广阔的水体是太平洋，风将美国加利福尼亚州海岸的帕西菲卡海浪吹起了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">喷雾</span>。</p>\n<p>随着太阳的照射，在喷雾“幕”中形成了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">海浪虹</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mila Zinkova","location":"美国加利福尼亚帕西菲卡","latitude":"纬度: 37° 35' 51'' N","longitude":"经度: 122° 30' 46'' W","date":"27 January 2016 1514 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.3"}]}]}